   "इत्यादिकंइत्यन्तं पाठं गङ्गाधरो न पठति."
  ],
  "lines_iast": [
   "māṃsasrotāṃsyanugato janayettu tṛtīyakam",
   "saṃśrito medaso mārgaṃ doṣaścāpi caturthakam",
   "ityādikaṃityantaṃ pāṭhaṃ gaṅgādharo na paṭhati."
